/* ============================================================================
   Spine Posture Monitor - cloud edition
   Seeed XIAO ESP32-C3 + GY-521 (MPU6050), worn on the upper spine.

   What changed from the standalone version
     - No more local web server / local dashboard for posture data. This
       device has no screen of its own - everything is monitored from the
       Spine Monitor cloud dashboard, from anywhere, not just your home Wi-Fi.
     - No Wi-Fi credentials in this file anymore. On first boot (or whenever
       it can't reach previously-saved Wi-Fi), the device opens its own
       access point named "PostureSetup-XXXX" (password below). Connect to
       it with your phone, a setup page should open automatically; if not,
       visit http://192.168.4.1. Pick your home network, enter the password,
       submit. Once connected, that same page shows this device's key -
       paste it into the dashboard's "Add device" form. Saved credentials
       persist across reboots, so this only happens once per device (or
       again automatically if it ever can't reconnect - e.g. after a router
       password change).
     - Every CHECKIN_MS it POSTs its current readings to Supabase (a single
       RPC call: device_checkin) and, in the same round trip, finds out
       whether you clicked "Calibrate" on the dashboard since the last check.
       If so, it runs the same guided 60 s calibration as before, reporting
       its phase/countdown back with each check-in so the dashboard can show
       a live overlay.
     - Everything else - the sensor fusion, posture classifier, continuous
       vibration alert, and battery monitoring - is unchanged from the
       standalone version.

   Libraries: none beyond what ships with the ESP32 Arduino core
   (WebServer and DNSServer, used only during setup, are both part of it).
   Board: "XIAO_ESP32C3". Set your Supabase details below and flash - that's
   the only thing left to edit in this file.
   ========================================================================== */

